{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.poster.avif?t=1764930021\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.webm?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/2f5a76a7dc6b6c1b60a6633e92b93ee9.mp4?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Break into an elite</strong> <strong>all-girls campus. Flirt, sneak, do missions and don\u2019t get caught. Easy, right?</strong>  <br>Welcome to <strong>School Crisis</strong> \u2014 a chaotic, anime-inspired co-op adventure where <strong>up to 4 players team up as intruders</strong> while <strong>1 player takes on the role of the principal</strong>, the relentless hunter patrolling the school.<br><br>You and your not-so-innocent friends are sneaking into an elite all-girls campus, each with your own questionable motivations. Whether you're trying to impress a crush, prove a point, or just be a nerd on a mission, your goal is simple:  <br><strong>complete missions, avoid the principal, and escape with your dignity intact</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/61b03d20b317e0cdb2dc12a5aaf6da64.poster.avif?t=1764930021\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/61b03d20b317e0cdb2dc12a5aaf6da64.webm?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/61b03d20b317e0cdb2dc12a5aaf6da64.mp4?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Each guy has his own vibe, animations, and dialogues. They can only talk to <i>one</i> specific girl on campus\u2014pick wrong, and she\u2019ll scream, attack, or straight-up expose your location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective-Based Missions</strong> \u2013 Talk to the girls, collect what they want, and bring it back\u2026 preferably without getting caught by the principal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Principal Who Hunts You</strong> \u2013 She\u2019s fast, furious, and armed with a shinai she has <i>absolutely no business swinging that hard</i>. Stealth helps, teamwork helps more, but nothing saves you from the smack if she catches you slipping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Your Friends\u2026 or Don\u2019t</strong> \u2013 If a teammate gets captured, you can break them out\u2014 or  run for the exit while they scream your name. No judgement. (Okay, maybe a little.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy Meets Chaos</strong> \u2013 <i>A ridiculous blend of panic and anime absurdity.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.poster.avif?t=1764930021\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.webm?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/a25723bbc804b93a7d3efe73506feb30.mp4?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School Crisis isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a test of stealth, teamwork, friendship, and who\u2019s got the guts to flirt their way through danger. Are you ready to cause chaos in the most prestigious girls\u2019 campus of the year? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.poster.avif?t=1764930021\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.webm?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/extras/15701863abd8651c9cba9e5a3634f6a7.mp4?t=1764930021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777300?t=1764930021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/4efe5d5b62687509ad75de281fe9715728574ac5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764930021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/696e12dc432b0cafb85033e68273f056f8dab951/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764930021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777300/696e12dc432b0cafb85033e68273f056f8dab951/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764930021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some female characters wear swimsuits or revealing clothing. No sexual content or explicit scenes.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute